  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Sets: greatest and least overlap</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Core 1.1 (e): Find the greatest and least possible numbers in both of two groups from the group sizes and the total.</p><p id="edition">Core</p><p id="provenance">This question is adapted from the revision exercise on page 75, question 2 of School Mathematics Project, SMP Book 2 (Metric), ed. A. G. Howson, Cambridge University Press, 1966: the smallest and largest possible overlap of two groups; places in Kenya, counts not percentages, every number new.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Core Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
